@startuml 22_Activity_Calculate_Settlement
title Activity - Calculate Net Balances and Simplified Settlement Plan (D09, D21, D34)

start
:Input: groupId (single group only, D21);
:Load ledger postings for the group\n(effective versions of APPROVED expenses:\npayer +amount, participants -share;\ncompleted payments: debtor +x, creditor -x);
:Convert every delta to integer cents (no floating point);
:net(m) = sum of deltas per member\n(members without postings = 0);
if (sum of all nets == 0?) then (no)
  :Throw LedgerInconsistencyException\n(alert; no payment possible);
  stop
endif
:C = members with net > 0 (creditors);\nD = members with net < 0 (debtors, amount = -net);
:Sort C and D by (amount DESC, user id ASC);
:i = 0; j = 0; transfers = [];
while (i < |D| and j < |C|?) is (yes)
  :x = min(D[i].rem, C[j].rem);
  :append Transfer(D[i] -> C[j], x);
  :D[i].rem -= x; C[j].rem -= x;
  if (D[i].rem == 0?) then (yes)
    :i = i + 1;
  endif
  if (C[j].rem == 0?) then (yes)
    :j = j + 1;
  endif
endwhile (no)
:Assert all remainders are 0\n(conservation, SP-1);
:Return SettlementPlan(transfers)\n<= k-1 transfers; deterministic;\nNOT guaranteed globally minimal (SP-8);
note right
  O(k log k) time, O(k) memory.
  Plan is derived, never stored (DA-12).
end note
stop
@enduml
